      "cooked": "<p>FWIW I’ve been seeing reports of similarly discounted SCRPG books out in the wild in some discount book stores for months now.  Someone dumped them in at least moderate numbers, although whether it was GTG or some game/book distributor I can’t say.  Might even have been some superbacker (most likely a retail store) who decided they don’t want to sit on them any longer.</p>",
